"модели ECOS даты хранятся как DATE, ссылки — как ASSOC, а список "
"``dates`` — как множественный JSON."
msgstr "Calendar configuration attributes are shown with Kotlin/Java data types. In the ECOS model, dates are stored as DATE, references as ASSOC, and the ``dates`` list as a multivalued JSON attribute."

